  "summary": "The SPM-4000 Dual Controller monitors two spaces and runs a separate control loop for each. On BACnet MS/TP it gives both pressures, both controller outputs, per-space modes and alarm limits, and setpoints and tuning for each loop. Unlike the single-loop SPM-4000 it has no temperature, humidity, flow or air-change objects.",
